---
---

<section class="section-alt text-center">
  <div class="container pb-5">
    <div class="mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
      <h2 class="mb-3 mx-auto" style="max-width: 800px;">Why Do 95% of our students score 15+ points higher? <br />Because AI adapts to <em>you</em>.</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 600px;">No generic videos. No waiting for teacher replies. Get instant explanations when you're confused.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-2 pt-4">
      <div class="problem-card card" data-aos="fade-right">
        <div class="icon-header mb-3">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-error"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"></line><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"></line></svg>
          <h3 class="mt-2">The Old Way</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="comparison-list">
          <li>Expensive monthly tuitions forcing you to pay for everything</li>
          <li>Outdated teaching methods that don't adapt to you</li>
          <li>Mass classes where your doubts are often ignored</li>
          <li>Fixed schedules that don't respect your time</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="solution-card card" data-aos="fade-left">
        <div class="icon-header mb-3">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-success"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
          <h3 class="mt-2">The ChampionsPrep Way</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="comparison-list">
          <li><strong>Pay-Per-Chapter (₹59):</strong> Only ₹500-1200 for full curriculum vs. ₹5000+ for tuition</li>
          <li><strong>Get Corrections in 30 Seconds:</strong> No waiting days for teacher feedback</li>
          <li><strong>Weak Topics? AI Assigns Extra Practice:</strong> Adaptive learning paths tailored to YOUR gaps</li>
          <li><strong>7-Day Money-Back Guarantee:</strong> Try one chapter. Get full refund if not satisfied.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .comparison-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--size-3);
  }

  .comparison-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: var(--size-6);
    font-size: var(--font-size-2);
  }

  .comparison-list li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--cp-purple-deep);
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .text-error { color: var(--cp-error, #f44336); }
  .text-success { color: var(--cp-success); }

  .problem-card, .solution-card {
    background-color: var(--cp-white);
    color: var(--cp-slate-dark);
  }

  .problem-card {
    border-top: 4px solid var(--cp-error, #f44336);
  }
  
  .solution-card {
    border-top: 4px solid var(--cp-success);
  }
</style>
